# Plugin Documentation

## Where

- **Single source of truth**: `documentation/content/docs/` — all docs as MDX. Index/entry: `index.mdx`. Sidebar is file-based.

No separate `docs/` folder; everything lives in the docs app.

## When

- New feature → new `.mdx` in `documentation/content/docs/` + link in `index.mdx`.
- API/behaviour/attribute changes → update relevant doc and key files section.

## Format

- **File**: `documentation/content/docs/<name>.mdx`.
- **Frontmatter**: `title`, `description`.
- **Sections**: Overview, Editor/UI, Data model/API, Key files (paths like `src/...`, `includes/...`).
- Use fumadocs-ui components where helpful (e.g. `Files`, `Folder`, `File`, `Tabs`, `Tab`).

## Checklist (new feature)

1. Add `documentation/content/docs/<feature>.mdx` (frontmatter + content).
2. Add entry in `documentation/content/docs/index.mdx`.
